HordesPaper — Server-Only Paper 26.3 Port of The Hordes
=======================================================

This plugin is a clean-room Java 25 / Paper 26.3 reimplementation inspired by and
derived from the design, configuration schema, and game mechanics of:

  The Hordes (NeoForge 1.21.1, version 1.6.3f)
  Original Author : smileycorp (SmileycorpMC)
  Original Source : https://github.com/SmileycorpMC/The-Hordes
  Modrinth Release: https://modrinth.com/mod/the-hordes/version/1.21.1-1.6.3f
